    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:linkConsequent is functional: a causal link has exactly one caused kind, the single consequent event type that the antecedent kind brings about. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
