    skos:definition "Asserts that a gmeow:CausalLink's gmeow:linkAntecedent and gmeow:linkConsequent must be distinct: nothing type-causes itself. The native coherence gate raises a violation when they coincide. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
